# CODEOWNERS — auto-requests review from the right people based on the
# files a PR touches. Combined with branch protection's "require review
# from Code Owners" setting, this enforces that no Bruno scenario lands
# without spec-team eyes, and no Dockerfile / workflow change without
# ops-team eyes.
#
# IMPORTANT: replace these placeholder usernames / teams with actual UIC
# accounts once the repo transfers. While the repo is on TOP-PHE, the
# default owner is @TOP-PHE so every PR routes there.
#
# Order matters: more specific rules later in the file override earlier
# generic ones.

# ── Default owner — fallback for everything not matched below ────────────
*                                              @TOP-PHE

# ── Server (Node.js runner, REST API, admin UI) ──────────────────────────
/Oscar_Server/                                 @TOP-PHE
/Oscar_Server/src/db/                          @TOP-PHE
/Oscar_Server/src/api/                         @TOP-PHE

# ── Bruno collection — owned by the OSDM specification team ──────────────
# Once UIC has the @UICrail/osdm-spec team, replace @TOP-PHE here:
/Bruno_Collection/                             @TOP-PHE
/Documentation/Bruno_Collection/               @TOP-PHE

# ── Deployment, CI/CD, container supply chain — ops team ─────────────────
/OSCAR_Deploy/                                 @TOP-PHE
/.github/                                      @TOP-PHE
/.github/workflows/                            @TOP-PHE
/Documentation/Server_Operations/              @TOP-PHE

# ── Compatibility matrix — release manager only ──────────────────────────
# This file decides which server↔collection combination is "tested" and
# therefore gates Watchtower's :stable rollout. A wrong entry can ship a
# broken combo to all operators. Keep it on the maintainer's plate.
/compatibility.json                            @TOP-PHE

# ── Security policy — security team only ─────────────────────────────────
/SECURITY.md                                   @TOP-PHE

# ── Documentation (operator/architecture) — anyone but reviewed ──────────
/Documentation/                                @TOP-PHE
/README.md                                     @TOP-PHE
/CHANGELOG.md                                  @TOP-PHE
